WEBVTT

00:44.730 --> 00:48.800
Don't die on me, Aki.

00:52.330 --> 00:55.890
So that when I die...

00:57.310 --> 00:58.660
You can cry for me.

00:58.990 --> 01:00.910
Snake: Swallow it whole.

01:14.300 --> 01:15.130
Leave.

01:34.810 --> 01:36.860
The Fiend ran off.

01:37.240 --> 01:41.370
We're after Chainsaw's heart. 
Don't bother with her.

02:02.720 --> 02:05.480
This time, I'm gonna split him in two.

02:06.380 --> 02:08.350
Don't damage the heart.

02:09.940 --> 02:12.730
I dunno what the fuck's going on...

02:13.570 --> 02:18.760
But it's easy enough to tell 
you two are bad guys.

02:20.390 --> 02:23.380
I love bad guys, y'know...

02:23.380 --> 02:27.750
Nobody gives me any shit 
when I carve 'em up!

02:28.840 --> 02:31.720
So I get to kill you a second time.

02:47.230 --> 02:53.540
Die!

04:30.070 --> 04:31.670
This is Sawatari.

04:31.670 --> 04:35.190
We've engaged Chainsaw on the third 
floor of the Nerima Nishidai building.

04:36.280 --> 04:37.440
Send reinforcements.

05:04.900 --> 05:05.900
Yeow!

05:30.050 --> 05:31.310
Do we shoot?

05:31.900 --> 05:34.060
Aim for the arms or the heart.

05:43.570 --> 05:45.280
Asshole!

05:48.910 --> 05:50.970
Ow, ow, ow...

05:50.970 --> 05:53.540
Huh. When'd he even cut me?

05:54.910 --> 05:56.960
Ow!

05:59.810 --> 06:01.790
Hey, bad guy!

06:02.390 --> 06:04.500
He's one of your buddies, right?

06:05.190 --> 06:06.880
What's your point?

06:08.420 --> 06:10.900
I dare you to move a millimeter!

06:10.900 --> 06:14.890
Or I'll turn your buddy-boy's
 head into ground beef!

06:15.900 --> 06:17.840
Asshole.

06:20.900 --> 06:24.020
Yeah, that's right! Sit your ass down!

06:27.720 --> 06:28.400
Where'd he go?

06:43.590 --> 06:47.590
Let's move him. Get the car, now.

06:50.250 --> 06:51.500
Hurry it up.

06:52.830 --> 06:57.130
All of Chainsaw's people should be dead.

07:08.270 --> 07:10.610
I guess Devil Hunters are still human...

07:12.340 --> 07:14.650
Meaning they can't win against guns.

07:42.650 --> 07:43.590
Guns...

07:47.290 --> 07:48.930
We're almost at the station.

07:48.930 --> 07:51.440
Let's move through the cars 
and split up among the civvies.

08:08.430 --> 08:09.510
Tendo!

08:11.020 --> 08:16.530
Special Divisions 1 through 4 all came 
under assault in Tokyo.

08:18.020 --> 08:21.020
Seriously? Is Ms. Makima dead?

08:21.020 --> 08:23.550
Ugh. Have we been wasting our time here?

08:53.210 --> 08:54.210
Wha...

08:57.000 --> 09:00.020
Kurose. Tendo.

09:01.030 --> 09:03.910
There was a shooting on the train.

09:03.910 --> 09:06.540
The bodies are still there, 
so take care of them.

09:06.540 --> 09:08.400
The lunch meeting is canceled.

09:08.400 --> 09:10.690
There were shots fired in Tokyo, too.

09:10.690 --> 09:12.490
Ms. Makima, you're covered in blood!

09:12.490 --> 09:14.150
Were you hit?!

09:14.750 --> 09:16.200
This isn't mine.

09:17.210 --> 09:18.980
I wasn't shot.

09:36.960 --> 09:39.480
Things are in chaos over there,

09:39.480 --> 09:42.180
so we don't have a lot 
of reliable information.

09:42.180 --> 09:45.790
They're apparently still 
confirming the casualties.

09:46.600 --> 09:50.190
So... should we head to Tokyo 
as backup right now?

09:51.030 --> 09:53.520
We won't make it in time if we do.

09:54.370 --> 09:57.580
The enemy is probably after Denji.

09:58.110 --> 09:59.670
I'll do what I can from here.

10:00.440 --> 10:04.830
Kurose, I need you to borrow 30 convicts 
with life sentences or worse

10:04.830 --> 10:06.580
from the Ministry of Justice.

10:06.950 --> 10:12.590
Tendo, find the nearest temple with 
the highest altitude, and reserve it.

10:14.520 --> 10:15.590
Also...

10:16.690 --> 10:18.940
I need some clean clothes, if you would.

10:39.670 --> 10:41.070
Where are we going?

10:41.070 --> 10:42.120
Hell if I know.

10:42.120 --> 10:44.240
Hey, no talking back there.

11:19.720 --> 11:20.750
Ms. Makima...

11:22.900 --> 11:24.520
They're almost here.

11:25.400 --> 11:27.000
Thank you, Tendo.

11:28.100 --> 11:29.510
I'll be right there.

11:53.130 --> 11:54.050
Move it.

11:58.830 --> 12:01.240
I'm gonna be out of action for a bit.

12:01.700 --> 12:02.500
Mm.

12:03.810 --> 12:06.580
So heavy... Gimme a hand here!

12:07.090 --> 12:09.170
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

12:10.380 --> 12:11.600
Hold him up on that end.

12:13.100 --> 12:14.950
How exactly is this supposed to work?

12:21.010 --> 12:22.130
Hey!

12:22.130 --> 12:24.010
Hey, come on already!

12:25.970 --> 12:28.760
Something's... what the hell?

12:28.760 --> 12:31.140
Quit freaking out! Just lift.

12:31.140 --> 12:33.600
I'm telling you, something's weird!

12:35.610 --> 12:37.400
What exactly do you mean by...

12:49.710 --> 12:53.410
Team E, have Team C verify Makima's body.

12:54.620 --> 12:57.290
This is Team E. Team E here.

12:57.660 --> 12:59.920
Team C hasn't been in contact since...

13:09.300 --> 13:10.800
That bitch.

13:40.910 --> 13:43.070
Why exactly are we blindfolded?

13:43.840 --> 13:47.720
Ms. Makima reports directly 
to the Chief Cabinet Secretary.

13:48.140 --> 13:53.040
Rank-and-file Devil Hunters like us don't have
clearance to know about her devil contracts.

13:59.450 --> 14:02.610
Say the name "Shuzo Mishima."

14:03.480 --> 14:05.990
Shuzo Mishima...

14:14.710 --> 14:16.400
We need to get Chainsaw moving, now!

14:16.400 --> 14:17.290
G-Got it!

14:20.520 --> 14:22.290
Hey! Into the car!

14:22.770 --> 14:24.300
Damn it! Are you listening to me?!

14:24.300 --> 14:25.300
Mishima!

14:42.040 --> 14:44.910
Say the name "Takashi Inoue."

14:45.750 --> 14:47.820
Takashi Inoue...

14:58.990 --> 14:59.790
Hey!

15:13.930 --> 15:14.830
No!

15:15.950 --> 15:16.680
Hey!

15:17.930 --> 15:18.980
Hey!

15:20.980 --> 15:22.810
Somebody help!

15:43.080 --> 15:44.320
It's over.

15:56.120 --> 15:57.550
You can take those off.

16:08.250 --> 16:11.120
That's all that can be done from here.

16:11.990 --> 16:13.630
I need to get back to Tokyo.

16:18.410 --> 16:21.290
A bullshit power like this 
is bound to be Makima.

16:22.680 --> 16:24.600
Let's get out of here while we still can.

16:24.600 --> 16:28.230
Damn it! I thought they killed her.

17:09.000 --> 17:10.370
You two...

17:13.260 --> 17:15.530
are with the shooters, aren't you?

17:17.510 --> 17:18.260
Snake.

17:18.260 --> 17:19.530
Tail!

17:27.430 --> 17:28.440
What is she, a monkey?!

17:51.410 --> 17:52.250
Shit!

17:52.250 --> 17:54.150
You can die in the van!

18:36.910 --> 18:40.270
I'm sorry I tried to kill you the other day.

18:51.000 --> 18:55.310
Apologizing for attempted murder... 
What the heck?

19:16.470 --> 19:19.470
This is bad... I'm freaking out!

19:35.970 --> 19:37.870
He protected me.

19:38.420 --> 19:41.990
It's my... my fault...

19:42.830 --> 19:45.270
I... I'm just...

19:52.230 --> 19:56.590
I can't do this... This job 
is going to drive me nuts!

19:59.190 --> 20:02.870
I'll have to tell Himeno 
I'm quitting when I see her again.

20:17.990 --> 20:21.000
I'm glad to see you alive, Madoka.

20:21.000 --> 20:23.150
How much of the Special Divisions survived?

20:23.530 --> 20:28.340
Special Divisions 1, 2, 3, and 4 
all came under assault,

20:28.340 --> 20:31.540
and just about everyone is dead 
except for the non-humans.

20:32.070 --> 20:35.670
An assault with guns,
targeting the Special Divisions...

20:35.670 --> 20:38.190
It seems like the Gun Devil 
must be involved.

20:39.910 --> 20:41.580
I've got a message from up above.

20:41.920 --> 20:47.680
Due to the personnel shortage, Divisions 1,
 2, and 3 will be absorbed into 4.

20:47.680 --> 20:50.680
And as of now, Public Safety Devil 
Extermination Special Division 4

20:51.180 --> 20:53.170
will be under your command, Makima.

21:02.360 --> 21:03.760
Also, this.

21:03.760 --> 21:04.820
What is it?

21:05.490 --> 21:06.820
My resignation.

21:07.780 --> 21:09.100
You're quitting?

21:09.560 --> 21:12.410
The Special Division seems 
like bad news at this point.

21:12.410 --> 21:15.080
I figure the choice is between 
quitting or getting killed.

21:16.200 --> 21:17.240
I see.

21:27.960 --> 21:29.830
There's one last thing I'm curious about.

21:31.260 --> 21:35.850
How much of what happened today 
did you anticipate, Ms. Makima?

21:37.730 --> 21:41.560
I'm afraid I can't share Public 
Safety intel with private citizens.

21:42.640 --> 21:45.240
Thank you for your service, Madoka.

21:45.990 --> 21:47.520
I'll pass this along.

22:04.120 --> 22:06.380
Uh... Ms. Makima,

22:06.380 --> 22:09.760
you know we're not actually joining 
your Special Division, right?

22:10.230 --> 22:12.590
We're just here to help with training, okay?

22:12.590 --> 22:15.630
And in a week, we'll be 
heading right back to Kyoto.

22:18.630 --> 22:19.710
That's a shame.

22:20.800 --> 22:23.800
The dining in Tokyo is to die for.
